#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:1
msgid "ThreadSanitizer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:3
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:5
msgid ""
"ThreadSanitizer is a tool that detects data races. It consists of a compiler "
"instrumentation module and a run-time library. Typical slowdown introduced "
"by ThreadSanitizer is about **5x-15x**. Typical memory overhead introduced "
"by ThreadSanitizer is about **5x-10x**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:10
msgid "How to build"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:12
msgid "Build LLVM/Clang with [CMake](https://llvm.org/docs/CMake.html)."
msgstr ""

