#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:327
msgid "Adaptive Delay"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:329
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:331
msgid ""
"Adaptive Delay is an optional ThreadSanitizer feature that injects delays at "
"synchronization points to explore novel thread interleavings and increase "
"the likelihood of exposing data races. By perturbing thread scheduling, "
"adaptive delay creates more opportunities for concurrent accesses to shared "
"data, improving race detection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:337
msgid "Adaptive delay is particularly useful for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:339
msgid "Detecting races in rarely-executed thread interleavings or code paths"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:340
msgid "Testing parallel data structures and algorithms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:342
msgid ""
"When enabled, adaptive delay maintains a configurable time budget to balance "
"race exposure against performance overhead. The delays can be"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:345
msgid "random amount of spin cycles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:346
msgid "a single yield to the OS scheduler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:347
msgid "random usleep"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:349
msgid "The strategy prioritizes high-value synchronization points:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:351
msgid ""
"Relaxed atomic operations receive cheap delays (spin cycles) with low "
"sampling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:352
msgid ""
"Synchronizing atomic operations (acquire/release/seq_cst) receive moderate "
"delays with higher sampling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:354
msgid ""
"Mutex and thread lifecycle operations receive the longest delays with "
"highest sampling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:357
msgid ""
"The delays focus on synchronization points with clear happens-before "
"relationships, as those are most likely to expose data races."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:360
msgid "Enabling Adaptive Delay"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ThreadSanitizer.md:362
msgid ""
"Adaptive delay is disabled by default. Enable it by setting the "
"`enable_adaptive_delay` flag:"
msgstr ""

